    "ASSUMPTION:" comment next to the section it affects.

    Assumptions used on this page:
      1.  Minimum age of 18.
      2.  Governing law / jurisdiction: Bangladesh.
      3.  Ownership of campaign deliverables passes per the brand-influencer
