      4.  Refunds, cancellations and settlement timing are not stated as
          fixed rules.
      5.  Liability cap is expressed relationally (fees paid), not as a figure.
      6.  What happens to held funds and open collaborations when an account
          is terminated.
      7.  The platform fee is described as "the rate in effect", never as a
          number, because PLATFORM_COMMISSION_PERCENT is configurable.

    None of this is legal advice. A qualified adviser should review the page
    before it is relied on.
*@

